{"ID":"20240118151010-etwm2sl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151010-etwm2sl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151010-etwm2sl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151011-uusoxxg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204103949-8r5k7gi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153526-zsmrbn2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:170,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:170\u0026#125;","title":"293羊踯躅","type":"doc","updated":"20240204103949"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151011-uusoxxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151011-uusoxxg","updated":"20240122153507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有大毒。治贼风在皮肤中淫淫痛，温疟，恶毒，诸痹。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153510-tqzmzpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153510-tqzmzpl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国广东广西四川一带，花冠为漏斗状，色黄似杜鹃花而大。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153511-755cgni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153511-755cgni"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，有大毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153513-dcu5p6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153513-dcu5p6j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】羊踯躅为诸风湿痹痛药，主痛风走注，风痰湿痹，治蛊毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153514-9vhiy4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153514-9vhiy4z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】邪气鬼疰，蛊毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153516-6t6c24f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153516-6t6c24f"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通分许 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153517-3xmjd65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153517-3xmjd65"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】羊食其草，踯躅而死，有毒之药，宜慎用之，近眼令人昏翳，其根误服，亦能杀人，中毒者，绿豆汁解之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153507-8pz3o83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153507-8pz3o83"}},{"ID":"20240122153526-xjk9m1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153526-xjk9m1y"}},{"ID":"20240122153526-zsmrbn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153526-zsmrbn2","updated":"20240204103940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第293，这个叫羊踯躅。羊踯躅使用得也不多。我们有一些药，像这个蔓陀罗，羊踯躅，很多都是我们过去，华佗使用那个麻沸汤，吃了麻醉药，开刀时使用，现在我们不用它，很少使用，因为现在西药的麻醉很盛行，所以我们的临床经验没有那么多，哦，以前用这些毒药来做麻醉啊，够好，那诸位可以参考一下，名字来源很好玩，因为羊吃到，这个草，吃到到以后，开始踯躅，脚不断地这样跳动，然后死掉了，吃太多了。"}]},{"ID":"20240204103949-8r5k7gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204103949-8r5k7gi"}}]}